  "query": "-- The S3 access key stays in the settings row because it is an identifier, not a\n-- credential. The secret key is not projected: the shared encrypted store owns\n-- it, and the service resolves it through that store alone.\nSELECT\n    storage_root,\n    max_upload_size_mb,\n    trusted_proxy_enabled,\n    s3_endpoint,\n    s3_region,\n    s3_bucket,\n    s3_prefix,\n    s3_path_style,\n    s3_access_key\nFROM context69.runtime_file_library_settings\nWHERE singleton = TRUE\n",
